sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant App
    participant AddTodo
    participant TodoList
    participant TodoItem
    participant Button
    participant LocalStorage

    User->>Browser: Open the Todo app
    Browser->>App: Mount React component
    App->>LocalStorage: Read saved todos
    LocalStorage-->>App: Return saved list or empty array
    App->>TodoList: Pass todos, onToggle, and onDelete
    TodoList->>TodoItem: Render each todo item
    TodoItem->>Button: Render Add/Delete button styling

    User->>AddTodo: Enter a new task
    User->>AddTodo: Submit the form
    AddTodo->>App: onSubmit(event)
    App->>App: Trim input and validate

    alt Input is valid
        App->>App: Create new todo object
        App->>App: Update todos state
        App->>LocalStorage: Save updated list
        App->>TodoList: Re-render with new task
        TodoList->>TodoItem: Display newly added item
    else Input is empty or too short
        App-->>AddTodo: Set error message
        AddTodo-->>User: Show validation feedback
    end

    User->>TodoItem: Click checkbox
    TodoItem->>App: onToggle(todo.id)
    App->>App: Toggle completed status
    App->>LocalStorage: Save updated list
    App->>TodoList: Re-render with updated status

    User->>Button: Click delete action
    Button->>App: onDelete(todo.id)
    App->>App: Remove matching todo from state
    App->>LocalStorage: Save updated list
    App->>TodoList: Re-render without deleted item
